  "title" "Antistasi Ultimate - Mafia PvPvEvE Extender"
  "description" "Adds a crime family, the Mafia Syndicate, to Antistasi Ultimate.

- A hidden hideout with Don Salvatore and his guards. Find it, raid its stash, kill the Don.
- Protection rackets that spread through towns where the rebels are weak. Kill the collectors to break them.
- Hit squads that come after whoever raids the family.
- Runs on the server: works on an existing campaign, and as a server mod players need nothing extra.
- Two faction templates for new campaigns: the Mafia as the rebel faction, or as the rival faction.
- Experimental: players can join the Syndicate (off by default).

Requirements:
- Arma 3 (v2.06+)
- Antistasi Ultimate - Mod

Source & Issues:
https://github.com/mirrorsedgepro-stack/A3UE-Mafia-PvPvEvE"
  "changenote" "Initial release v1.0.0"
